From 1fd22c5e009da3ac31b5f149fac25d0c1921f73b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Myles Liu <lyx981mike@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:03:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommax: ipq50xx: add Xiaomi Redmi AX3000 (RA81) with NSS

Board support modelled on the Xiaomi CR8806 (same IPQ5000 + QCN6102 + QCA8337,
256 MiB) with the RA81 specifics from lutvzn/RA81OpenWRT (v25.12.5 port):

- DTS: QCA8337 CPU port 6 over SGMII (MX2000 layout, vendor MAC6_SGMII),
  TZ 4 MiB, TSENS off, NSS heap 8 MiB, coherent_pool=512K, CR8806 Wi-Fi
  memory layout with the Xiaomi-Redmi-AX3000 calibration variant
- RA81 board data (IPQ5000 board 0x24, QCN6102 0x60) in ipq-wifi files/
- Xiaomi dual-boot A/B upgrade with rollback (preinit arm, init confirm)
- ECM fraglist GRO off, as for the CR8806, in a uci-defaults file of its own
  (the ath11k 256M memory profile is set in the build config)
- drop the NSS bring-up debug options (serial SysRq, unrestricted /dev/mem)

Single-slot layout: the third-party QCA U-Boot on this board publishes no
SMEM partition table and keeps no flag_* environment, so the xiaomi-dualboot
A/B helpers (lib/functions, lib/preinit/81_, etc/init.d, lib/upgrade) have no
slot to work with. Drop them and upgrade the one rootfs UBI volume set in
place (CI_UBIPART=rootfs + nand_do_upgrade), the way the stock-layout ports do.
---
 .../uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx   |   1 +
 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile            |   2 +
 .../files/board-xiaomi_redmi-ax3000.ipq5018   | Bin 0 -> 131184 bytes
 .../files/board-xiaomi_redmi-ax3000.qcn6122   | Bin 0 -> 131184 bytes
 .../qualcommax/dts/ipq5018-redmi-ax3000.dts   | 519 ++++++++++++++++++
 target/linux/qualcommax/image/ipq50xx.mk      |  26 +
 .../ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/01_leds    |   3 +
 .../ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network |   1 +
 .../etc/hotplug.d/firmware/11-ath11k-caldata  |   2 +
 .../etc/uci-defaults/15_ra81_ecm_gro_list     |  13 +
 .../base-files/lib/upgrade/platform.sh        |   9 +
 .../linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/config-default   |   4 -
 12 files changed, 576 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/files/board-xiaomi_redmi-ax3000.ipq5018
 create mode 100644 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/files/board-xiaomi_redmi-ax3000.qcn6122
 create mode 100644 target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq5018-redmi-ax3000.dts
